flowchart LR
    A[Launch application] --> B[Load experiments and settings]
    B --> C[Open UI shell]
    C --> D[Select preset and edit draft]
    D --> E{Start now or queue?}
    E -->|Start now| F[Create or replace run session]
    E -->|Queue| G[Append queued run]
    G --> H{Active run exists?}
    H -->|No| F
    H -->|Yes| I[Wait in queue]
    F --> J[Drive ticks and render frames]
    J --> K{Run finished, stopped, or replaced?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Record run history and output path]
    L --> M{More queued runs?}
    M -->|Yes| F
    M -->|No| N[Idle until next request]
